{
  "folder": "twA4EvH7ITGXKuxk",
  "name": "Drachen Blast",
  "type": "spell",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You blast a target within 60 feet of you with one of your elements. Make a spell attack against a creature in range. On a hit, you deal 1d6 damage of your attuned trait’s damage type. If you have Bond of Greed active, you deal additional damage equal to your attribute modifier.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You can make this attack as a melee or a ranged attack. If you make a melee attack you add your Strength modifier to the damage, you can choose to use your unarmed attack modifier. On a critical hit, you double the damage you deal and the target suffers persistent damage equal to a roll of a regular hit’s worth of damage.</span></p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong>Heightened (3rd) </strong>The damage of this attack increases to 2d6.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong>Heightened (6th) </strong>The damage of this attack increases to 3d6.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The damage of this attack increases to 4d6.</span></p>"
